		"description": "<p><strong>Soul Rite — Protect.</strong> 1 Action, Reach: 8. Remove Soul Touched from the target: it gains temp HP equal to your soul power, 1 round. If Soul Touched wasn’t removed, this does nothing.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using this Rite checks the target for your Soul Touched and removes it (the module warns but lets you proceed if the target isn’t marked).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls your soul power as temp HP. [M] Remove the temp HP after 1 round.</em></p>",
